--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
Third-party data
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------

This project analyses a dataset it does not own and does not redistribute:

  datasocial/tiktok-5.6B-videos  —  https://huggingface.co/datasets/datasocial/tiktok-5.6B-videos

That dataset is licensed CC BY-NC 4.0 (Attribution-NonCommercial 4.0 International), which
prohibits commercial use. Nothing here grants rights to it.

The repository contains two derived artefacts of that dataset:

- `data/fixtures/demo_sample.parquet` — 20,000 rows sampled from the source, included so a fresh
  clone can be demonstrated without downloading the full corpus.
- `deploy/vercel/data/sound_stats.parquet` — per-sound usage counts and median view counts computed
  from the training window, shipped so the serverless build can reconstruct features.

Both remain subject to CC BY-NC 4.0: non-commercial use only, attribution required. No full
partition is redistributed here.

Third-party Python dependencies remain under their own licences.

